WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:05.800
To see Eldest Brother vindicated is joyous news beyond measure!

00:06.200 --> 00:12.000
You cannot imagine how sleepless and anxious I have been these past days, searching incessantly for a way to plead his case.

00:12.120 --> 00:17.500
I came today specifically to convince Imperial Father to lift his confinement—and Father has already consented!

00:24.320 --> 00:31.500
Now that you have already brought the culprit, there is no reason to turn back. Make haste and report to His Majesty, Miss Chen.

00:33.120 --> 00:36.200
There is no need for the Prince of Jin to instruct me! Take him away!
